<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:<%= t['ink-950'] %>;">Your free trial of <%= planName %> ends on <%= chargeDate %></h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">On <strong><%= chargeDate %></strong> the card you gave us is charged <strong><%= priceText %></strong> for <strong><%= orgName %></strong>, and your plan carries on without a break.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If you cancel before then, you pay nothing. Tracking stops, your data stays readable for 90 days, and you can come back any time.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">If you stay, the first before-and-after results arrive in the weeks after you fix things, and you have 30 days after your first payment to ask for a full refund.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><a href="<%= billingUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:<%= t['brand-600'] %>;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;">See your plan</a></p>
